# SG Scout Backend — API 调试集合 (REST Client for VSCode / JetBrains)

@host = http://localhost:1324

### 健康检查
GET {{host}}/common/health

### 应用版本信息
GET {{host}}/common/version

### 应用设置
GET {{host}}/common/setting

### Demo - 多值查询参数绑定
GET {{host}}/demo/search?tag=go&tag=web&tag=api

### Demo - 路径参数绑定
GET {{host}}/demo/echo/hello

### CORS - OPTIONS 预检 (模拟浏览器跨域预检)
OPTIONS {{host}}/demo/search
Origin: https://example.com
Access-Control-Request-Method: POST

### CORS - 跨域 GET
GET {{host}}/demo/search?tag=go
Origin: https://example.com

# ================= Crawler module (feature 001 + 002) =================

### 引擎注册表（002：三引擎 + 能力/可用性）
GET {{host}}/crawler/engines

### 全局配置读取（002：DB 运行配置源）
GET {{host}}/crawler/settings

### 全局配置修改（部分更新，带 note 留痕）
PUT {{host}}/crawler/settings
Content-Type: application/json

{ "items": [ { "key": "default_engine", "value": "goquery" } ], "note": "切回默认引擎" }

### 全局配置重置（key 为空=全部）
POST {{host}}/crawler/settings/reset
Content-Type: application/json

{ "key": "", "note": "重置为默认" }

### 全局配置变更历史
GET {{host}}/crawler/settings/history

### 建档（goquery 深度任务，002 示例：瑞金医院境内站）
POST {{host}}/crawler/tasks
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "source_type": "web",
  "engine": "goquery",
  "entry_url": "https://www.rjh.com.cn/2018RJPortal/main/rjcz/mtsd/index.shtml",
  "depth": 0,
  "include_subdomain": false,
  "page_limit": 10
}

### 建档（crawl4ai 引擎示例）
POST {{host}}/crawler/tasks
Content-Type: application/json

{ "source_type": "web", "engine": "crawl4ai", "entry_url": "https://www.rjh.com.cn/2018RJPortal/main/rjcz/mtsd/index.shtml", "depth": 0 }

### 建档（未知引擎 → 400 明确错误）
POST {{host}}/crawler/tasks
Content-Type: application/json

{ "source_type": "web", "engine": "bogus", "entry_url": "https://example.com" }

### 任务列表
GET {{host}}/crawler/tasks

### 任务详情（含 runs / latest_run）
GET {{host}}/crawler/tasks/1

### 开始抓取（建档后手动开跑）
POST {{host}}/crawler/tasks/1/start

### 手动检查（重新抓取+指纹比对）
POST {{host}}/crawler/tasks/1/check

### 停止（queued/running 均可停）
POST {{host}}/crawler/tasks/1/stop

### 删除任务（级联，运行中 409）
DELETE {{host}}/crawler/tasks/1

### 整任务导出（zip 流）
GET {{host}}/crawler/tasks/1/export

### 单次执行详情（页面当次状态）
GET {{host}}/crawler/runs/1

### 重试该次执行的失败页（同 run 补抓）
POST {{host}}/crawler/runs/1/retry-failed

### 页面详情（正文+版本时间线+备份信息）
GET {{host}}/crawler/pages/1

### 指定版本正文
GET {{host}}/crawler/pages/1/versions/1

### 单页导出（zip 流）
GET {{host}}/crawler/pages/1/export

### 删除单个页面（级联版本与文件）
DELETE {{host}}/crawler/pages/1

### ================= 校对模块（feature 004 /proofreads）=================

### 校对文档列表（自由文本/派生为主；?page_id= 探测页面绑定文档）
GET {{host}}/proofreads

### 创建页面校对文档（1:1，重复 409）
POST {{host}}/proofreads
Content-Type: application/json

{ "source_type": "page", "page_id": 1 }

### 创建自由文本校对文档
POST {{host}}/proofreads
Content-Type: application/json

{ "source_type": "text", "title": "示例短文", "content": "这是一段需要校对\n的示例正文。" }

### 校对文档详情（底稿全文+卡片+派生链）
GET {{host}}/proofreads/1

### 升级底稿至页面最新版本（无新版本 409）
POST {{host}}/proofreads/1/upgrade

### 删除校对文档（级联卡片+日志）
DELETE {{host}}/proofreads/1

### 新建卡片：改正（重叠 400）
POST {{host}}/proofreads/1/cards
Content-Type: application/json

{ "op_type": "fix", "start_line": 1, "start_off": 0, "end_line": 1, "end_off": 2, "replacement": "正确", "reason": "错别字" }

### 新建卡片：增补（空点）
POST {{host}}/proofreads/1/cards
Content-Type: application/json

{ "op_type": "insert", "start_line": 1, "start_off": 2, "end_line": 1, "end_off": 2, "replacement": "，补充", "reason": "缺标点" }

### 编辑卡片字段（不改状态）
PATCH {{host}}/proofreads/1/cards/1
Content-Type: application/json

{ "reason": "修正理由" }

### 状态改判：已接受
POST {{host}}/proofreads/1/cards/1/state
Content-Type: application/json

{ "status": "accepted" }

### 状态改判：已驳回（可填理由）
POST {{host}}/proofreads/1/cards/2/state
Content-Type: application/json

{ "status": "rejected", "reject_reason": "此处无误" }

### 删除卡片
DELETE {{host}}/proofreads/1/cards/1

### 校对日志（只读）
GET {{host}}/proofreads/1/logs

### 修订稿预览（revised+marks；无已接受 400）
GET {{host}}/proofreads/1/revision

### 导出纯净修订稿
GET {{host}}/proofreads/1/revision/export

### 导出勘误表（CSV，仅已接受）
GET {{host}}/proofreads/1/errata/export

### 基于修订稿派生新校对文档
POST {{host}}/proofreads/1/revision-doc
